  &=\{q\,q^{n-1},p\}\\
  &=q\{q^{n-1},p\}+\{q,p\}q^{n-1}\\
  &=(n-1)q^{n-1}+q^{n-1}\\
  &=nq^{n-1}.
  \end{aligned}$ 线性性把结果推广到多项式和收敛的幂级数表示。更直接地，括号的定义对每一个可微的$f(q)$给出式 [eq:l8-translation-derivative]： $\{f(q),p\}
  =
  \frac{\partial f}{\partial q}
  \frac{\partial p}{\partial p}
  =f'(q).$

